    "passives": {
      "HailToTheKingPassiveAKingArthurModernBoss": {
        "id": "HailToTheKingPassiveAKingArthurModernBoss",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Regal Successor",
          "description": "If this unit would be defeated, it instead survives with 1 HP and then cannot be defeated until its next turn. This effect can trigger only once each time this unit enters the battlefield, and is considered a Hold Ground+ effect.\n\nThis unit cannot be Stunned until it has defeated 1 enemy with an attack while on the battlefield.\n\nThis unit's attacks ignore any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n\nAfter entering the battlefield, for 100TU, after the end of each of this unit's turns, this unit will randomly either:\n- Disable the enemy with the lowest current TU for 30TU. When a unit's Active Skills are disabled and they get the turn, they will lose the turn as if they were sleeping. This effect cannot affect boss units, cannot be purified, and will end if this unit is defeated.\n- Give the next turns to all other allies on the battlefield by reducing their current TU. These TU reductions may trigger before or after other effects that adjust the turn order.\n- Fortify 2 random non-fortified allies. A Fortified unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks. This reduction cannot be ignored by attacks that do not specifically ignore Fortify. Fortify will be removed after reducing damage 3 times since applying, and will be reset if reapplied. This is not a status effect."
        }
